      "jcr:created": "Fri Nov 19 2021 19:36:51 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">We understand that in today’s challenging healthcare environment, our customers need solutions that improve quality, efficiency, safety and patient outcomes. These needs are creating opportunities for us, together with our customers, to make healthcare better.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
